                "text": "I was glad to attend the ribbon cutting for LVHN\u2019s first neighborhood hospital in Macungie. It offers a full-service emergency department, imaging services, and can admit patients when needed, allowing our growing community easy access to high level healthcare. https://t.co/7P5xKFVl2V",
