                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This morning, I had the pleasure of attending the\u00a0Southern Lehigh Municipal Update Meeting, where I took questions from community members and talked about how we\u2019re making real investments in securing our communities, funding salary and healthcare for our military service members and veterans, and helping those in need. I also spoke about how I am using my position to advocate for American workers and, specifically, working families. Always great to hear what matters most to Greater Lehigh Valley residents\u00a0and keep working to deliver results real for them!",
