                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Join us tomorrow (Tuesday, 4/22) at 3 PM for a Social Security pre-retirement webinar. This informational event will cover Retirement, Spouse, Survivor, and Child benefits, COLA adjustments, and Medicare and the Social Security Administration's online services. RSVP here: https://t.co/4YGog5yWNI",
