                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Whether it\u2019s trouble with Social Security or another federal agency, our team is here to help.\n\nThanks to Aaron in our district office, Richard was able to resolve a complicated issue with his Social Security and Medicare prescription plan. After months of confusion and deductions from his check, his full benefits were restored in his April payment.\n\nIf you need help with a federal matter, don\u2019t hesitate to reach out: https://t.co/qNPGOUfs3R.",
