                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "From helping veterans access the benefits they\u2019ve earned to resolving issues with Social Security, Medicare, and passports\u2014our office is here to help. We\u2019ve resolved over 1,200 cases for constituents across the Greater Lehigh Valley, and we\u2019re just getting started. Need assistance? Reach out to one of our district offices here: https://t.co/qNPGOUfs3R",
