                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Had a great visit with PenTeleData \u2014 a locally owned company that\u2019s been connecting businesses and communities for over 30 years. With thousands of miles of fiber optic network, they\u2019re helping power everything from healthcare to education to local businesses right here in the Greater Lehigh Valley. Proud to see local companies leading the way in innovation and community support.",
