                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Unnecessary delays for prior authorization in Medicare Advantage plans have diminished patient care and added complexity to the treatment process for seniors. That's why I'm proud to co-sponsor H.R. 3514 \u2013 a bill that streamlines care by creating an electronic prior authorization process, facilitating real-time decision-making, and mandating greater transparency from insurers.",
