                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My team was able to attend @RepHeffleyPA & @SenatorArgall annual Senior Expo today in Carbon County, which was attended by more than 1,000 seniors!\n\nWe shared how our office can help seniors with federal services \u2014 from Social Security and Medicare to veteran\u2019s benefits and more. Our seniors have given so much to our communities, and we owe it to them to ensure they get the support and respect they deserve.",
