                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I recently had the opportunity to recognize Hitcho Insurance Agency for their work helping seniors and Medicare-eligible individuals find the right coverage. Thank you to everyone in the Lehigh Valley and the Poconos who work hard to help seniors get the benefits and coverage that they need.",
