                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Was proud to cosponsor H.R. 3128, the Improving Diaper Affordability Act of 2025, which treats diapers like other essential healthcare expenses so parents can cover the cost through their health accounts and prohibits state and local governments from imposing sales taxes on them. As a father to a young son, I know how important this is, especially when 1 in 2 families in America struggles with diaper need. Every baby deserves a healthy start, and no parent should have to choose between diapers and other necessities.",
                "text_lang": "en",
