                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Proud to Cosponsor the Nancy Gardner Sewell Medicare Multi-Cancer Early Detection Screening Coverage Act. New technologies can allow patients to screen for a range of cancers with one blood test, helping to improve early detection. This bipartisan bill will allow Medicare to cover these tests. Learn more: https://t.co/q49J6U1rHI",
