                "text": "The people of the Lehigh Valley and the Poconos want to see commonsense, bipartisan reforms to our healthcare system. That\u2019s why I\u2019m working with colleagues on both sides of the aisle to deliver reforms that reduce costs, enhance transparency, and eliminate waste. \n\nLearn more: https://t.co/UOwG8jfuEV",
